          "_name": "article10",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article10\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Video\" name=\"showVideo\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ff8f7a\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#550000\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-content-text\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>Registrations</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">1. Competition Categories</h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Filmmakers are invited to submit their work in the following primary competitive categories:<br>\n<br><b>Short Fiction Film:</b> Independent storytelling focusing on original themes with high artistic value.\n<br><b>Short Documentary Film:</b> A sanctuary for documentary realism, seeking films that translate human stories and complex realities into compelling visual archives.\n<br><b>Short Animated Film:</b> Innovative works that push the boundaries of creative animation across all techniques.<br>\n<br><i>Note on Competition Structure: Please be aware that our festival categories are still undergoing changes as we work to best represent the diversity of modern storytelling. If you have any suggestions for new categories or specific themes you would like to see included, please contact us. Your feedback is essential in helping us shape a truly inclusive platform.</i></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>2. Submission Guidelines &amp; Eligibility</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">•\tAge Requirement: The competition is open to filmmakers aged 16 and over.\n<br>•\tProduction Timeline: Entries must have been produced between 2025 and 2027 to ensure the festival reflects the most current creative perspectives.\n<br>•\tRuntime: Short fiction and documentary entries should not exceed 60 minutes. Short animations should be under 30 minutes.\n<br>•\tLanguage &amp; Subtitles: All non-English language films must include hardcoded English subtitles for international judging and screenings.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>3. Technical Specifications</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">All submissions must be made digitally through our registration platform.\n<br>Preferred Formats: Selected films must be available in professional formats such as MP4 HD, MOV, or DCP for cinema projection.\n<br>Promotional Materials: Upon selection, filmmakers are required to provide three high-resolution film stills (300 dpi) and a short director’s biography for the festival catalogue.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>4. Selection Process &amp; Awards</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">A curated selection of the best entries will be showcased at authentic and inspiring cinema locations across Bucharest during the ZIFF 2027 Summer Summit.\n<br>Jury Evaluation: Films will be reviewed by an independent professional Jury established by the festival organizers.\n<br>Main Prizes: Awards will be presented for the Best Fiction, Best Documentary, and Best Animated Film.\n<br>Special Recognition: The Jury may grant additional distinctions for \"Fresh Voices\"—emerging talents who demonstrate exceptional innovation in their filmmaking approach.<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>5. Important Deadlines for ZIFF 2027</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Submissions Open: September 2026\n<br>Early-Bird Deadline: TBD<br>Final Call for Entries: TBD<br>Selection Notification: TBD<br>ZIFF 2027 Festival Dates: TBD<br></p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          </div>\n          <div mbr-video mbr-if=\"showVideo\" class=\"mbr-figure m-auto col-12 col-md-{{videoWidth}} mt-3\">\n          <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-BSQlJxCDcI&loop=1&autoplay=1\"></iframe>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
