          "_name": "article13",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article13\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#550000\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n           <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ff8f7a\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b>How It All Started</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Some lessons cannot be taught. They have to be lived, built and felt — in the nerves before a premiere, the excitement of seeing a project come together, and the applause at the end.\n<br>\n<br>Some of our most meaningful learning experiences have happened alongside young people, through projects that pushed us out of our comfort zones and brought us closer together. That is how the first Zoom In Short Film Festival came about — from courage, determination and a desire to do something that could make a difference.\n<br>\n<br>Together with the IBSB students volunteering with the “Adoptă o Casă” programme, we wanted to create more than a school event. We wanted a charity film festival open to young people from across Bucharest. We wanted to support the “Adoptă o Casă” programme in Roșia Montană, which has spent 15 years helping to preserve the area’s built heritage. And we wanted to hold the festival somewhere with a story of its own: Cinema Europa, Bucharest’s last remaining neighbourhood cinema, which is currently undergoing an exciting process of revitalisation.\n<br>\n<br>Getting there was intense, challenging and very real. There were Sunday mornings at 7 a.m. in the cinema, working on the festival’s visual identity, promotion, sponsorships, media partnerships, contracts, GDPR, automations and hundreds of messages. There were difficult decisions, unexpected problems and solutions we had to find along the way. Most of all, there was an extraordinary level of commitment.\n<br>\n<br>And the students did it not because they needed another line on their CVs. Most of them already had excellent opportunities ahead of them. They did it because they wanted to create something that mattered to someone beyond themselves.\n<br>\n<br>The idea itself was born from a setback. The previous year, we had tried to organise a film competition within our school, and it simply didn’t work. This time, we decided to open the doors wider. We thought perhaps 30 young people might enter. In the end, there were five.\n<br>\n<br>And you know what? Five was enough.\n<br>\n<br>Because every film took courage. Every young filmmaker had a voice. And we learned that success is not always measured in numbers. Sometimes it is measured by meaning.\n<br>\n<br>We are deeply grateful to everyone who supported us and encouraged us when we were beginning to doubt ourselves: Claudia Apostol, Andreea Duminicioiu, Cristiana Dumitru and the Cinema Europa team. We are grateful to our sponsors, Catena, UniCredit and HBO; our media partners, Euronews, ProTV and Frame Film; our jury, Corina Șuteu, Paula Antonia Cămîrzan and Mihai Mănescu; and Silvia Dragic and Tangaj Productions.\n<br>\n<br>Most of all, we are grateful to the young people who had the courage to submit their films and to everyone who came to watch them.\n<br>\n<br>Zoom In was more than a festival. It showed us what can happen when a team believes in an idea — and in a cause bigger than itself.\n<br>\n<br>And that was just the beginning.\n<br>\n<br>We are already preparing for the second edition, with even more enthusiasm for what comes next.\n<br>\n<br>The Zoom In Team: Theodor Aizic, Marc Paraschiv, Rareș Stanciu, Tommaso Bianchi, Andrei Stoenescu, Ecaterina Boțan, Rucsandra Florea, Sarmiza Bădeliță, Mara Mestecăneanu, Sofia McGregor, Aya Menner, Ilana Costache, Rita Bartoș, Petru Robatzchi and Johanna Croci\n<br>\n<br>Photography: Dragoș Ilie</p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary-outline\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        Start now\n                        </a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
