          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article15\" group=\"Article\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" value=\"6\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#550000\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>The Roșia Montană Connection</b></h5>\n                <h6 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"medium\">Roșia Montană is a site of exceptional historical value, featuring over 2,000 years of mining history and the largest number of heritage monuments in any Romanian village. The ZIFF initiative serves as a primary pipeline for the Heritage Summer Campaigns, where cinematic engagement in the city transitions into hands-on restoration in the mountains. Participants and supporters contribute to the \"scientific endeavor\" of saving structures using traditional materials like lime-sand mortar and wooden shingles.</h6>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n              <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-0\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"medium\"><b>Media Assets &amp; Accreditation\n</b><br><br>We invite members of the press to explore the convergence of art and advocacy.<br>\n<br><b>Press Kits:</b> High-resolution film stills, festival logos, and technical restoration data are available upon request.<br>\n<br><b>Interviews:</b> Interviews can be arranged with our Student Founders and our professional mentors, including Johanna Croci.<br>\n<br><b>Publications:</b> Press members may request digital copies of our technical manuals, such as the Intervention Guide for Roșia Montană, which document the rigorous restoration methodologies supported by the festival.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
