          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#550000\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"><b>A Legacy of Cinema and Heritage</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The Zoom in Film Festival (ZIFF) offers a unique opportunity for visionary partners to align themselves with a movement that synthesizes youth-led creative initiative and professional heritage conservation. By sponsoring ZIFF 2027, your organization becomes a vital catalyst for both the future of cinema and the preservation of over 2,000 years of history.<br><br>Our Financial Commitment: The 50/50 Model<br>To ensure the maximum impact of your contribution, ZIFF 2027 operates on a transparent investment model:<br>\n<br>•\t<u>50% Direct Heritage Impact:</u> Half of your investment is channeled directly to the ARA Association. These funds provide the material foundation for high-priority restoration projects in Roșia Montană, supporting traditional crafts like lime-sand plastering and stone masonry.\n<br>•\t<u>50% Festival Sustainability:</u> The remaining 50% is reinvested into the growth of the festival. This allows us to elevate production standards, expand our audience reach, and ensure that ZIFF remains a premier sanctuary for \"engaged cinema\" and a platform for a new generation of storytellers.\n<br>\n<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
