          "_name": "article12",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article12\" group=\"Article\">    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#550000\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4 mt-0\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                <b>Contacts</b></h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">The storytelling magic of photos\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">1. General &amp; Submission Inquiries\n<br>For information regarding the 2027 Call for Entries, technical specifications for \"engaged cinema,\" or general questions about our upcoming programming in Bucharest:\n<br>Email: contact@zoomin-filmfest.com\n<br>Subject: General Inquiry / Submissions – [Your Name/Film Title]\n<br>Note: Submissions are not yet open. Please follow our digital channels for the official announcement.<br><br>2. Press &amp; Media Relations\n<br>For media accreditation, requests for our Brand Kit, or to schedule interviews with our student founders—Marc Paraschiv and Theodor Aizic—and our professional mentor, Johanna Croci:\n<br>Email: press@zoomin-filmfest.com\n<br>Subject: Press Inquiry – [Organization Name]<br><br>3. Partnerships &amp; Philanthropy\n<br>To discuss corporate social responsibility (CSR) goals, sponsorship opportunities, or how your contribution supports both the arts and the ARA Association’s restoration efforts in Roșia Montană:\n<br>•\tEmail: partners@zoomin-filmfest.com\n<br>•\tSubject: Partnership Opportunity – ZIFF 2027<br><br>4. Integrity &amp; Ethics Reporting\n<br>As an independent entity committed to international standards of excellence, we provide a confidential channel to report any concerns regarding fairness or professional conduct [Conversation History]:\n<br>•\tEmail: ethics@zoomin-filmfest.com\n<br>•\tSubject: Fairness Report – Confidential\n<br><br>Stay Focused: Follow Our Channels\n<br>Join our digital community to receive real-time updates on venues, curated screenings, and the launch of our summer campaigns:\n<br>•\tInstagram: @zoomin_filmfest\n<br>•\tOfficial Website: <a href=\"https://zoomin-filmfest.com\" class=\"text-primary\">www.zoomin-filmfest.com</a><br><br>Our Collaborative Partners\n<br>ZIFF 2027 proudly maintains a strategic collaboration with the ARA Association and the \"Adopta O casa\" program. For technical questions regarding specific restoration sites, such as the Mining Museum’s Lapidarium, or to inquire about traditional crafts, please contact our partners directly:\n<br>Asociația ARA\n<br>•\tEmail: contact@adoptaocasa.ro\n<br>•\tPhone/WhatsApp: 0731/38.33.33\n<br>•\tAddress: 5, Regina Elisabeta Blvd., Bucharest\n<br>ZIFF 2027: Bridging the distance between the screen and the stones.\n<br>&nbsp;<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
