 In Film Festival (ZIFF)</strong> sunt deținute și administrate de către <strong>Asociația Cadru cu Cadru</strong>. Evenimentul este organizat și gestionat din punct de vedere comercial sub brandul operațional <strong>Seaside Branding</strong> (deținut de <strong>Emil-Marc Paraschiv Persoană Fizică Autorizată</strong>), în baza parteneriatelor și drepturilor de operare aplicabile.\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                        The <strong>Zoom In Film Festival (ZIFF)</strong> project and trademark are owned and managed by <strong>Asociația Cadru cu Cadru</strong>. The event is organized and commercially operated under the operational brand <strong>Seaside Branding</strong> (owned by <strong>Emil-Marc Paraschiv Persoană Fizică Autorizată</strong>), under applicable partnerships and operating rights.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <hr class=\"my-4 legal-divider\">\n\n                    <div class=\"row legal-entities g-4 mt-2\">\n                        <!-- Entity 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                            <div class=\"p-4 rounded entity-card h-100\">\n                                <h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-1 entity-title\">1. Asociația Cadru cu Cadru</h5>\n                                <p class=\"entity-subtitle small mb-3\">Owner &amp; Trademark Holder</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-unstyled mb-0\">\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Legal Name:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">Asociația Cadru cu Cadru</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">CIF / CUI:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">[Introduceți CIF-ul Asociației]</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Reg. Asociații și Fundații:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">[Introduceți Nr. Registru]</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Address:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">[Introduceți Adresa Sediu Social]</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Email:</span> <a href=\"mailto:contact@zoomin-filmfest.com\">contact@zoomin-filmfest.com</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Entity 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"col-md-6\">\n                            <div class=\"p-4 rounded entity-card h-100\">\n                                <h5 class=\"fw-bold mb-1 entity-title\">2. Seaside Branding</h5>\n                                <p class=\"entity-subtitle small mb-3\">Commercial &amp; Operational Management</p>\n                                <ul class=\"list-unstyled mb-0\">\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Legal Name:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">Emil-Marc Paraschiv Persoană Fizică Autorizată</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">CIF / CUI:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">55505906</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Reg. Com.:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">F2026041945003</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">EUID:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">ROONRC.F2026041945003</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-2\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Address:</span> <span class=\"entity-val\">Str. Ion Minulescu, Nr. 13, Sector 3, București, România</span></li>\n                                    <li class=\"mb-1\"><span class=\"entity-label\">Email:</span> <a href=\"mailto:contact@seasidebranding.com\">contact@seasidebranding.com</a></li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Action Buttons -->\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-4\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-app-buttons=\"true\">\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-privacy display-4 me-2\" href=\"/privacy\">Privacy Policy</a>\n                    <a class=\"btn btn-tos display-4\" href=\"/tos\">Terms of Service</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
